{"t":"005070.KS","n":"Cosmo Advanced Materials & Technology Co., Ltd.","nKo":"코스모신소재기술","ex":"KSE","cur":"KRW","px":32150.0,"chg":3400.0,"chgPct":0.11826,"prev":28750.0,"dayH":32700.0,"dayL":29550.0,"w52H":66400.0,"w52L":26600.0,"vol":107916,"avgVol":69876,"mcap":1067470422016,"pe":null,"fpe":26.33,"eps":null,"feps":null,"pb":null,"div":null,"divY":0.0,"beta":1.36,"short":null,"shortPct":null,"shortRatio":null,"prof":{"c":"South Korea","cKo":"대한민국","s":"Basic Materials","sKo":"기초재료","i":"Specialty Chemicals","iKo":"특수 화학물질","city":"Chungju-si","emp":null,"web":"https://www.cosmoamt.com","sum":"Cosmo Advanced Materials & Technology Co., Ltd. provides secondary battery cathode active materials in South Korea and internationally. The company manufactures and supplies high-Ni cathode active materials used in electric vehicles and energy storage systems, including lithium cobalt oxide, as well as used in secondary batteries for IT, such as smartphones, tablet PCs, and laptops. It also provides MLCC release films and semiconductor, and toner, as well as black printer, color printer, black copier, and color copier toner. The company was formerly known as Seahan Media Co., Ltd. and changed its name to Cosmo Advanced Materials & Technology Co., Ltd. in March 2011. Cosmo Advanced Materials & Technology Co., Ltd. was founded in 1967 and is headquartered in Chungju-si, South Korea.","sumKo":"코스모신소재는 2차전지 양극활물질을 국내외에 공급하고 있습니다. 리튬코발트산화물 등 전기차, 에너지저장장치 등에 사용되는 하이니켈(High Ni) 양극활물질은 물론 스마트폰, 태블릿PC, 노트북 등 IT용 2차전지에 사용되는 양극활물질을 제조, 공급하고 있다. 또한 MLCC 이형필름과 반도체, 토너를 비롯해 블랙프린터, 컬러프린터, 블랙복사기, 컬러복사토너도 공급하고 있다. 회사는 이전에 Seahan Media Co., Ltd.로 알려졌으며 2011년 3월 Cosmo Advanced Materials & Technology Co., Ltd.로 이름을 변경했습니다. Cosmo Advanced Materials & Technology Co., Ltd.는 1967년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 충주시에 본사를 두고 있습니다."},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":485605240000,"ni":27021400000},{"y":2023,"rev":629579000000,"ni":26949000000},{"y":2024,"rev":569728590000,"ni":17717180000},{"y":2025,"rev":456295850000,"ni